{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1789227678532,"sessionID":"ses_f69b86532ffep26IC0FB2m9weq","part":{"id":"prt_09647bb40001M6UM6LidVK33uA","messageID":"msg_09647b72e001x2QIYhPHUR8zsy","sessionID":"ses_f69b86532ffep26IC0FB2m9weq","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1789227822767,"sessionID":"ses_f69b86532ffep26IC0FB2m9weq","part":{"id":"prt_09649e917001kjbfiSxG7cnDJl","messageID":"msg_09647b72e001x2QIYhPHUR8zsy","sessionID":"ses_f69b86532ffep26IC0FB2m9weq","type":"text","text":"先說明數學與演算法步驟：\n\n**PCA 數學**：設中心化資料 $\\tilde X = X - \\mu$（$\\mu$ 為各欄平均）。樣本共變異數矩陣為 $C = \\frac{1}{n-1}\\tilde X^\\top \\tilde X$。用 `np.linalg.eigh(C)` 得特徵值 $\\lambda_1 \\le \\dots \\le \\lambda_d$ 與其特徵向量，把特徵值由大到小排序，前 $k=10$ 個特徵向量即主成分軸 $W\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times 10}$；主成分得分為 $Z = \\tilde X W$。可解釋變異為 $\\lambda_i$，佔比為 $\\lambda_i / \\sum_j \\lambda_j$。\n\n**驗證對照**：sklearn `PCA(n_components=10, svd_solver='full')` 的 `explained_variance_ = S_i^2/(n-1)`（$S_i$ 為奇異值），與我的手刻特徵值在數學上相同；`components_` 的列為 $W^\\top$，但特徵向量符號有自由度，所以用「符號對齊」後逐一比對載入向量、得分與重建。\n\n先確認套件版本後建立程式檔：","time":{"start":1789227821335,"end":1789227822764}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789227827448,"sessionID":"ses_f69b86532ffep26IC0FB2m9weq","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_e87f2d1abb0443a3a3cf9ba4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"uv run python -c \"import numpy, sklearn; print(numpy.__version__, sklearn.__version__)\""},"output":"2.5.3 1.9.1\r\n","metadata":{"output":"2.5.3 1.9.1\r\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"uv run python -c \"import numpy, sklearn; print(numpy.__version__, sklearn.__version__)\"","time":{"start":1789227822701,"end":1789227827431}},"id":"prt_09649ec62001vl3ra8rb7VIrar","sessionID":"ses_f69b86532ffep26IC0FB2m9weq","messageID":"msg_09647b72e001x2QIYhPHUR8zsy"}}
{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1789227827448,"sessionID":"ses_f69b86532ffep26IC0FB2m9weq","part":{"id":"prt_0964a00ea0013WZF9DhZ5cy2MP","reason":"tool-calls","messageID":"msg_09647b72e001x2QIYhPHUR8zsy","sessionID":"ses_f69b86532ffep26IC0FB2m9weq","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":18355,"input":7882,"output":8681,"reasoning":0,"cache":{"write":0,"read":1792}},"cost":0}}
