{"type":"text","timestamp":1789228540339,"sessionID":"ses_f69abb172ffeDarDKAA7BOMHKQ","part":{"id":"prt_09654db810016N24xoRfCb7prr","messageID":"msg_0965492450015rsLW3UKL17nS1","sessionID":"ses_f69abb172ffeDarDKAA7BOMHKQ","type":"text","text":"現況掌握完成：`figs/` 目前是空的（無 `lab1_k_selection.png`），`notes/` 只有兩個 log，`lab3` 無輸出檔，`lab2-output.log` 全 PASS 是執行證據。\n\n我先建立任務清單，接著委派兩個唯讀子任務，並同時撰寫 lab1-review.md。","time":{"start":1789228538753,"end":1789228540330}}}
